      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500750074002D00EA00740072006500200070006C0075007300200074006100720064002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "*soupir*...\nReviens me voir quand tu auras plus de temps.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
